hpc:User a owl:Class .
hpc:Account a owl:Class .
hpc:Association a owl:Class .
hpc:FairShare a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:User ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

hpc:hasAncestor a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:User ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Account .

hpc:hasLevelFSValue a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Account ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

hpc:RootAccount a owl:Class, rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
    hpc:hasAncestor hpc:RootAccount .

hpc:Tree a owl:Class .
```

This ontology fragment defines the classes `User`, `Account`, `Association`, and `RootAccount`. It also defines the datatype properties `FairShare`, `hasAncestor`, and `hasLevelFSValue`. The `RootAccount` class is a special case of both `User` and `Account`, and it has no ancestors. The `Tree` class is not instantiated in this example, but it could be used to represent the rooted plane tree structure.
